#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Create an info file under :file:`/etc/univention/templates/info/`. Name the "
"file after the package, for example :file:`{PACKAGENAME}.info`."
msgstr ""
"Erstellen Sie eine Info-Datei unter :file:`/etc/univention/templates/info/`. "
